        <mxCell id="integration-note" value="Integration Points:&#xa;• KeyCloak validates SSO tokens for TRE API (grayscale arrow)&#xa;• Unified app gets theme configs from Config API (NOT MFE registry!)&#xa;• CDN serves single app to all entities (runtime theming)&#xa;• Application Gateway routes to both existing TRE API and new KeyCloak (grayscale arrow)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#d79b00;fillColor=#ffe6cc;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="80" y="1440" width="740" height="100" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="deployment-note" value="Deployment Notes (UNIFIED APPROACH):&#xa;• NEW components (color) deployed alongside existing TRE v0.28 (grayscale)&#xa;• Existing TRE API remains on App Service (no migration required)&#xa;• AKS subnet added to existing Hub VNet&#xa;• Application Gateway updated to route to both old and new backends&#xa;• Zero-downtime gradual migration path supported&#xa;&#xa;IMPORTANT CHANGE:&#xa;• Single unified app deployment (NOT separate MFEs per entity)&#xa;• Runtime theming via Config API (NOT Module Federation)&#xa;• All 14+ orgs share same build (instant updates!)" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#82b366;fillColor=#d5e8d4;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=11;fontStyle=2;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="900" y="1500" width="900" height="180" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <mxCell id="architecture-approach-note" value="ARCHITECTURE APPROACH:&#xa;&#xa;This diagram shows the UNIFIED SINGLE APP architecture.&#xa;&#xa;Key Differences from Module Federation:&#xa;❌ NO separate Storage Accounts per entity MFE&#xa;❌ NO MFE registry in Config API&#xa;❌ NO dynamic remote module loading&#xa;&#xa;✅ Single app deployment (Static Web App or Storage)&#xa;✅ Runtime theme injection (CSS variables + JSON)&#xa;✅ Blob Storage for theme assets ONLY (logos/images)&#xa;✅ Config API returns theme JSON (not MFE URLs)&#xa;✅ 14+ orgs share same build → instant branding updates&#xa;&#xa;See: ui-shell-unified-architecture.drawio for frontend details" style="text;html=1;strokeColor=#ff9800;fillColor=#fff3e0;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=1;fontSize=12;fontStyle=1;spacingLeft=10;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="1840" y="1500" width="520" height="260" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

